:: Shopping Day 1b {"position":"3875,2300","size":"100,100"}
{=

(metadata:
"currency", "rial",
"title", "The Dry Food Warehouse",
"cardDesc", "Essential (and perhaps only) nutrition for pilgrims, caravaneers, sailors, and one journeying magus.",
"parent", "S: Shopping Day 1",
)

<!--To run a market (all temp var MUST be defined outside of any hook, so it goes at the beginning of the passage)
1. Define an item list (temp var). Can use (for:) to build list.
2. Define (a) buy factors and (b) sell factors, often using "table.marketPriceMod". Sell factor is usually a merge between the buy factors and its own things using $funcMarketMergeFactors.
3. Define (a)_baseBuyMod and (b) _baseSellMod.
4. Run readout: ($funcMarketReadoutFull:)
5. Run buy/sell menu: ($funcMarketMain:)
-->


<!--Market setup-->
<!--item list-->
(set: _itemList to (a: "supplies",))
<!--buy factor-->
(set: _buyFactors to (passage: "table.marketPriceMod")'s universalBuy)
<!--sell factor-->
(set: _sellFactors to ($funcMarketMergeFactors: _buyFactors, (passage: "table.marketPriceMod")'s universalSell))
<!--define base mods-->
(set: _baseBuyMod to 3)
(set: _baseSellMod to .5)
<!--end of market setup-->



$cssColumnParent[

$cssColumnChild[
     
     (css: "font-size: 70%")[
        $cssColumnChild[(link: "⇦ Never mind.")[(goto: (passage:)'s parent)]]
     ]

	$cssBox[
    	($funcImage: (passage: "S: Shopping Day 1")'s img)
         $cssBoxItem[''(print: (passage:)'s title )''<br>(print: (passage:)'s cardDesc)]
    ]
]

$cssColumnChild[
Excess foods that do not fit on cargo ships are resold here right by the warehouses next to the Exchange, where needy travelers are plenty.
<br>
Salted fish from nearby Rokhab, goat jerky from Sabzam upriver, water-grains from Zirab, glazed pastries with Yavanid names you cannot pronounce - all the things to keep yourself fed while on the road are neatly packed and laid out on rows and rows of stalls, each with a monger hawking their wares.
<br>
How long will your jounrey be? How big is your purse?

]<!--end child-->
]<!--end parent 1-->

---

$cssColumnParent[
$cssColumnChild[
<!--Readout-->
$cssDesc[($funcMarketReadoutFull: _baseBuyMod, _baseSellMod, _itemList, _buyFactors, _sellFactors)]
<!--end of readout-->
]<!--end child, begin another-->

$cssColumnChild[
<!--main buy/sell menu-->
<ol>
($funcMarketMain: _baseBuyMod, _baseSellMod, (passage:)'s currency, _itemList, _buyFactors, _sellFactors, 1)
<br>
Or...
<br>
<li>(link: "Never mind.")[(goto: (passage:)'s parent)]</li>
</ol>
<!--end of main buy/sell menu-->

]<!--end child-->
]<!--end parent 2-->